:HELP NAME=CFGTCPTELN.Configure TCP/IP TELNET (CFGTCPTELN)
:P.The Configure TCP/IP TELNET (CFGTCPTELN) command works with the
TELNET server menu.
:P.The command has no parameters.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGTELNA.Change TELNET Attributes (CHGTELNA)
:P.The Change TELNET Attributes (CHGTELNA) command works with the telnet
server's attributes, kept in the TCP/IP server table in QUSRSYS and read
when the server starts.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/AUTOSTART'.Autostart server (AUTOSTART)
:P.The autostart server for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/NBRSVR'.Number servers (NBRSVR)
:P.The number servers for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 200.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/NBRTASK'.Number of tasks (NBRTASK)
:P.The number of tasks for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 200.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/TIMMRKTIMO'.Session keep alive timeout (TIMMRKTIMO)
:P.The session keep alive timeout for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 2419200.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/ENBWIDE'.Enable 3270 wide-screen (ENBWIDE)
:P.The enable 3270 wide-screen for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/NBRFLDS'.Number of 3270 input fields (NBRFLDS)
:P.The number of 3270 input fields for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 126 to 9999.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *RPY.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/DFTNVTTYPE'.Default NVT type (DFTNVTTYPE)
:P.The default NVT type for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *VT100, *NVT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/CCSID'.Coded character set identifier (CCSID)
:P.The coded character set identifier&colon. the code page and character
set the data is in, or is to be converted to.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 65533.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *MULTINAT, *BRITISH, *DUTCH, *FINNISH, *FRENCH,
*FRENCHCAN, *GERMAN, *ITALIAN, *NORDAN, *SPANISH, *SWEDISH, *SWISS.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/TBLVTOUT'.Outgoing EBCDIC/ASCII table (TBLVTOUT)
:P.The outgoing EBCDIC/ASCII table for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CCSID:EPK.
:PD.The CCSID determines the conversion.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/TBLVTIN'.Incoming ASCII/EBCDIC table (TBLVTIN)
:P.The incoming ASCII/EBCDIC table for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CCSID:EPK.
:PD.The CCSID determines the conversion.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGTELNA/ALWSSL'.Allow Transport Layer Security (ALWSSL)
:P.The allow Transport Layer Security for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*ONLY:EPK.
:PD.The only one&colon. an error is sent when more than one matches.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=STRTCPTELN.Start TCP/IP TELNET (STRTCPTELN)
:P.Use the Start TCP/IP TELNET (STRTCPTELN) command to TELNET's other
name; a 5250 session with another system from this display, over TN5250
(RFC 2877 and 4777).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRTCPTELN/RMTSYS'.Remote system (RMTSYS)
:P.The remote system, by host name or internet address.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*INTNETADR:EPK.
:PD.The internet address given in INTNETADR.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 255 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRTCPTELN/INTNETADR'.Internet address (INTNETADR)
:P.An internet address in dotted decimal form (IPv4) or in colon form
(IPv6).
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 64 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRTCPTELN/CTLCHAR'.Control character key (CTLCHAR)
:P.The control characters in the data&colon. none, or the first
character of each record as a FORTRAN control character.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 1 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, '&amp.' is used.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRTCPTELN/KBDTYPE'.Keyboard language type (KBDTYPE)
:P.The keyboard language type for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LCL:EPK.
:PD.Local.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. AGB, AGE, AGI, AGM, ALI, ALM, BGB, BGE, BLI,
BLM, BRB, BRE, CAB, CAE, CAI, CAM, CLB, CLE, CSB, CSE, CYB, DMB, DME,
DMI, DMM, ESB, FAB, FAE, FAI, FAM, FNB, FNE, FNI, FNM, FQB, FQI, GKB,
GNB, GNE, HIB, HNB, HNE, ICB, ICE, ICI, ICM, INB, INI, IRB, ITB, ITE,
ITI, ITM, JEB, JEI, JKB, JPB, JPE, JUB, KAB, KOB, LAB, LAE, LTB, LVB,
MKB, MKE, NCB, NCE, NEB, NEE, NEI, NEM, NWB, NWE, NWI, NWM, PKB, PKE,
PLB, PLE, PRB, PRE, PRI, PRM, RCB, RMB, RME, ROB, ROE, RUB, RUE, SFI,
SFM, SGI, SGM, SKB, SKE, SPB, SPE, SPI, SPM, SQB, SQE, SSB, SSE, SSI,
SSM, SWB, SWE, SWI, SWM, TAB, THB, THE, TKB, TKE, TRB, TRE, UAB, UAE,
UKB, UKE, UKI, UKM, USB, USE, USI, USM, VNB, VNE, YGI, YGM, *TRNTBL.
:EHELP.
